DewfordTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_H0::
    .string "Word came over on the SLATEPORT\n"
    .string "boat: KANTO's CHAMPION crossed!\p"
    .string "If that's you, try the stone cavern\n"
    .string "at the edge of town. Rare stones\l"
    .string "turn up in there, they say.$"

DewfordTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_H1::
    .string "A CHAMPION from KANTO, resting in\n"
    .string "our little CENTER! Wait till the\l"
    .string "HALL hears about this.\p"
    .string "Here's one for your trip: even a\n"
    .string "fainted POKéMON can still use a\l"
    .string "move from a HIDDEN MACHINE (HM).$"
